  "description": "Bring soft romance, vintage charm, and handcrafted grace to your creative projects with Yolania, a brand new calligraphy script font. Designed with smooth handwritten loops, delicate cursive strokes, and a natural flowing rhythm, Yolania effortlessly adds an intimate and high-end feel to any visual composition. Set against a soft, aesthetic botanical backdrop filled with vintage floral illustrations, Yolania is the ideal choice for wedding invitations, luxury brand identity, floral packaging, photography watermarks, feminine logotypes, romantic quotes, greeting cards, and editorial layouts.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring soft romance, vintage charm, and handcrafted grace to your creative projects with Yolania, a brand new calligraphy script font. Designed with smooth handwritten loops, delicate cursive strokes, and a natural flowing rhythm, Yolania effortlessly adds an intimate and high-end feel to any visual composition. Set against a soft, aesthetic botanical backdrop filled with vintage floral illustrations, Yolania is the ideal choice for wedding invitations, luxury brand identity, floral packaging, photography watermarks, feminine logotypes, romantic quotes, greeting cards, and editorial layouts.</p>",
